<p>1. Thanks. It's intended to drive home that it once was human. An incredibly sheltered little girl who can't even grasp the concept of the sky or grass, even.<br />
2. Granted, please hold.<br />
3. They cannot imitate the voice of an individual that still lives, is what that was intended to convey.<br />
4. I'm not sure how. I figured the description of its upbringing, the medical logs, the initial statement they were identical to human infants would do it. I'm open to suggestions on this.</p>

